## 2. Aapke project ka structure

```text
GAMING SITE/
│
├── backend/
│   ├── src/
│   ├── .env           (GitHub par nahi jayegi)
│   ├── node_modules/  (GitHub par nahi jayega)
│   └── package.json
│
├── frontend/
│   ├── src/
│   ├── .env           (GitHub par nahi jayegi)
│   ├── node_modules/  (GitHub par nahi jayega)
│   └── package.json
│
├── .gitignore
├── package.json
└── README.md
```

## 3. GitHub par upload karne ki commands

VS Code Terminal mein project ke root folder se yeh commands run karo:

<CodeBlock language="powershell" editable>
# Check repository
git status

# Initialize only if Git is not initialized
git init

# Set main branch
git branch -M main

# Add all allowed project files
git add .

# Check staged files
git status

# Create commit
git commit -m "Initial RisePay Solution MERN Project"

# Connect GitHub repository
git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/risepay-solution.git

# Upload to GitHub
git push -u origin main
